/Title (The proposed Loan/Credit Eligibility Reasoning Engine combines Formal Query Language  \(FQL\)-based rule inference with live financial data to deliver accurate, transparent, and  explainable loan decisions. By integrating AI reasoning, real-time APIs, and risk assessment,  the system improves efficiency, reduces fraud, ensures regulatory compliance, and supports faster, fairer credit approvals. This approach demonstrates how Explainable AI can  modernize financial decision-making while maintaining trust and accountability.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 411 0 R
>>
